    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nutrition can be a driver of change or a barrier to progress, and, according to the Global Nutrition Report being released on September 22 in New York City, there are actions leaders of every country should be taking to end malnutrition in all its forms. Among the report's key findings: One in three members of the global population is malnourished, and the problem exists in every country on the planet-yet the strategies or \"high-impact interventions\" available to resolve it are not being implemented due to lack of money, skills or political pressure.",
